{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_033_02_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a91018fda61fd58a8010aaea7c027eb6dbaa6181d6d8ad1f72522d33e05c2138",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5af5106c0bf39a56facddd58d08ff99122ac717dc421f58c673ae51577c9e049",
      "text": "对主角绝对要保密！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0c8aee07825c442f2f8f63765a7ffd5212eba374eb0532696c70fccdb70cc87",
      "text": "马上就要迎来生日的志狼。\n坚信肯定有人在为自己筹划生日会的他，\n悄悄打探直央等人的动向，却完全没有任何痕迹。\n面对一如既往毫无异样的大家，志狼垂头丧气，然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000020:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000020:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5af5106c0bf39a56facddd58d08ff99122ac717dc421f58c673ae51577c9e049",
      "text": "对主角绝对要保密！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6fa4f75363506997382926f61df6c771b2d9ef2cccdc63ab53512a1720769b5",
      "text": "喂喂，制作人！\n4月22号那天，有什么安排吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc6e5ca1bd38170831bed634aa81f98fb998ecb615bc38791a9bb3f4d5117cfd",
      "text": "呃……是的。那天正如前几天通知的那样，\n有もふもふえん的舞蹈练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce1f6e6b9d5cf42c80e8d7bbff93b7e357a8fbc1350bef0eed7d748e55f752a1",
      "text": "那件事我知道啦！不是指那个啦——\n我是问那之后还有没有别的安排！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33c444f228b6e1c94af312ff4642f36ba681421d40d2fc7bea2701faa418c663",
      "text": "没有，特别的安排倒是……舞蹈练习结束后，\n大家就是自由时间了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a909440ede65070ebcd8720583d1e0dcc305620a1470c7a7e0f63398f1c06afa",
      "text": "所以说，那个我也知道啦！\n不是指那个——呃，就是说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96930d1cf9218a5d4366ea2bfce48dbf97ed8009e96ec05715d3f75e542e8292",
      "text": "（花、花音和直央的话，肯定懂我想说什么的吧……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54bbdff3d3399cc6d5017160ab248d668220d040aa2dd807ea4cd50e95fef010",
      "text": "……呜呜，今天的作业好难哦～。\n直央君，这个你会吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f174117b7233cb0dc614c5094c23169c601df02454f66cfeab41c43ab6b169ba",
      "text": "给我看看。\n啊，这个在课本的这里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e03d19cac61f0d364adc50959fd160ef02249d7f05fc9377d41b72843dfd7eb1",
      "text": "（完全没在听我说话嘛！\n唔、唔唔……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef17f089133f71b1d53adc91d151d775637ebccef20a44e173af9618c73eb1f3",
      "text": "（……！对啦，想到了个好主意）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
